1
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:04,730
Mommy...

2
00:00:04,813 --> 00:00:05,643
It's Mommy!

3
00:00:05,940 --> 00:00:06,840
She's here!

4
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:09,860
Are you sure?

5
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:11,880
Yes, I'm positive.

6
00:00:12,120 --> 00:00:14,977
Hey, I scanned again, and
it's Mommy's player ID!

7
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:17,620
Her coordinates are above us in the tree!

8
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:22,750
Kirito!

9
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:25,550
Wait!

10
00:00:26,640 --> 00:00:27,470
Kirito!

11
00:00:31,340 --> 00:00:33,720
Why are you acting like this, Kirito?

12
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:36,800
Is this person that important?

13
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:39,082
Are they worth all this trouble?

14
00:00:42,220 --> 00:00:43,920
Watch out, Kirito!

15
00:00:44,260 --> 00:00:45,966
You're gonna hit the barrier!

16
00:00:51,980 --> 00:00:52,810
Kirito!

17
00:00:55,180 --> 00:00:56,010
No!

18
00:01:00,800 --> 00:01:03,137
Stop it, Kirito! It's impossible!

19
00:01:03,220 --> 00:01:05,279
You can't get any higher from here!

20
00:01:07,360 --> 00:01:08,190
I have to!

21
00:01:08,273 --> 00:01:09,500
Dammit, I have to try!

22
00:01:12,240 --> 00:01:13,070
Mommy!

23
00:01:13,320 --> 00:01:14,440
I'm here, Mommy!

24
00:01:17,300 --> 00:01:18,130
Mommy!

25
00:01:42,800 --> 00:01:48,000
I don't want to go away.
I don't want to go away.

26
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:51,140
I won't be able to go away.

27
00:02:19,720 --> 00:02:21,120
Oh

28
00:03:17,640 --> 00:03:19,560
Ah! Mommy!

29
00:03:28,280 --> 00:03:29,120
Mommy!

30
00:03:30,580 --> 00:03:35,880
Yui, is that you? Mommy! Mommy! I'm here!

31
00:03:38,960 --> 00:03:40,260
I'm up here!

32
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:42,100
Where are you?

33
00:03:42,800 --> 00:03:44,480
Yui, I'm up here!

34
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:49,920
Kirito!

35
00:03:56,120 --> 00:03:57,002
Come on, think.

36
00:03:57,480 --> 00:04:01,304
There's got to be something I can
drop to let them know I'm here.

37
00:04:05,940 --> 00:04:07,587
Why can't I bust through it?

38
00:04:07,820 --> 00:04:11,702
I used warning mode to contact
her, but I don't know if it worked.

39
00:04:21,540 --> 00:04:22,400
What's that?

40
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:30,060
A card?

41
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:33,353
Leafa, do you know what this thing does?

42
00:04:33,920 --> 00:04:34,750
Uh-uh.

43
00:04:34,860 --> 00:04:37,272
I've never seen an item like that before.

44
00:04:39,900 --> 00:04:41,880
I can't access the menu on it.

45
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:44,400
Let's see...

46
00:04:45,140 --> 00:04:45,970
I got it!

47
00:04:46,053 --> 00:04:48,100
This is a system admin access code!

48
00:04:48,760 --> 00:04:49,590
Really?

49
00:04:49,673 --> 00:04:52,297
Do you think we can access
the GM controls with it?

50
00:04:52,380 --> 00:04:53,210
No.

51
00:04:53,940 --> 00:04:56,881
You need the right console
to access the controls.

52
00:04:57,080 --> 00:04:59,597
And the way to find it is
through the system menu.

53
00:04:59,680 --> 00:05:01,720
But even I can't bring that up.

54
00:05:02,040 --> 00:05:02,980
No one can.

55
00:05:03,500 --> 00:05:04,330
I see.

56
00:05:05,980 --> 00:05:10,240
Although, I doubt something like
this would just fall out of the sky.

57
00:05:11,800 --> 00:05:12,840
I wonder...

58
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:14,310
Yes!

59
00:05:14,393 --> 00:05:15,223
It's from Mommy!

60
00:05:15,306 --> 00:05:17,515
She must have heard us and dropped it!

61
00:05:26,460 --> 00:05:27,290
Asuna.

62
00:05:34,580 --> 00:05:36,320
Leafa, I got a plan.

63
00:05:36,620 --> 00:05:40,738
I need to know where the gate is
that'll get me inside the world tree.

64
00:05:41,040 --> 00:05:44,620
Well, the gate's in the dome
at the base of the tree, but...

65
00:05:45,440 --> 00:05:47,157
You're not thinking about going in there?

66
00:05:47,240 --> 00:05:49,637
The biggest raiding parties
couldn't even get through.

67
00:05:49,720 --> 00:05:51,797
The whole thing's protected by guardians.

68
00:05:51,880 --> 00:05:52,710
It doesn't matter.

69
00:05:52,793 --> 00:05:53,623
I have to try.

70
00:05:57,900 --> 00:05:58,730
It's okay.

71
00:05:58,813 --> 00:06:00,171
Thank you for everything.

72
00:06:01,120 --> 00:06:03,296
I'll be going on my own from here on.

73
00:06:28,460 --> 00:06:29,420
Kitty-toe.

74
00:06:38,220 --> 00:06:39,517
Should we get going now?

75
00:06:39,600 --> 00:06:40,430
Yeah, sure.

76
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:42,620
What the hell?

77
00:06:42,760 --> 00:06:43,760
Is this an event?

78
00:06:45,460 --> 00:06:47,813
Yui, do you know how to get to the dome?

79
00:06:48,640 --> 00:06:51,560
Yes, just go up those stairs and then...

80
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:57,180
Are you sure about this, Daddy?

81
00:06:57,780 --> 00:07:01,597
I'm only asking because based on
everything we've been told about the gate,

82
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:04,157
breaking in sounds like it's
going to be really hard.

83
00:07:04,240 --> 00:07:05,997
We don't have any other choice.

84
00:07:06,080 --> 00:07:08,668
Besides, it's not like
we'll die if we fail.

85
00:07:09,540 --> 00:07:11,128
Yeah, I guess you're right.

86
00:07:12,860 --> 00:07:15,017
If I have to spend another second waiting

87
00:07:15,100 --> 00:07:17,840
around doing nothing
I'm gonna lose my mind

88
00:07:19,740 --> 00:07:24,460
And I know you want to see mommy
too just as bad as I do I do

89
00:07:59,980 --> 00:08:02,940
Thou knowest not the
heights of heaven above.

90
00:08:03,880 --> 00:08:06,645
Test thou seek entry to
the castle of the king?

91
00:08:09,380 --> 00:08:10,840
I'm coming, Asuna.

92
00:08:11,940 --> 00:08:13,280
I'm almost there.

93
00:08:14,180 --> 00:08:15,140
Go then.

94
00:08:15,500 --> 00:08:18,100
Prove thou art worthy of thine wings.

95
00:08:18,400 --> 00:08:20,620
Prove thou art worthy of flight.

96
00:08:29,660 --> 00:08:31,040
Here we go, Yui.

97
00:08:31,380 --> 00:08:32,909
Keep your head down, okay?

98
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:35,240
Okay. Good luck.

99
00:08:42,900 --> 00:08:44,300
Let's go.

100
00:09:38,020 --> 00:09:39,940
Get out of my way!

101
00:09:47,820 --> 00:09:49,300
I can do this.

102
00:10:09,460 --> 00:10:10,957
I can do this.

103
00:10:11,040 --> 00:10:12,300
Arrgh!

104
00:10:25,260 --> 00:10:26,090
Die!

105
00:10:29,500 --> 00:10:30,380
Die, Team!

106
00:10:41,040 --> 00:10:41,870
No!

107
00:11:11,040 --> 00:11:11,870
Ah!

108
00:11:26,780 --> 00:11:35,870
Ahsuna!

109
00:11:58,040 --> 00:11:59,240
I'm almost there.

110
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:01,420
I'm almost there.

111
00:12:25,060 --> 00:12:28,100
Just a little further?

112
00:12:44,440 --> 00:12:50,520
I, I, I died.

113
00:12:54,720 --> 00:12:58,277
I always believed that deep

114
00:12:58,360 --> 00:13:02,020
down this world was just a game.

115
00:13:03,600 --> 00:13:06,880
Is this my punishment for thinking that?

116
00:13:08,820 --> 00:13:11,100
My strength in the game is a lie.

117
00:13:11,880 --> 00:13:14,720
Nothing more than a bunch
of skills and stats.

118
00:13:17,900 --> 00:13:20,320
I didn't give a damn about its rules!

119
00:13:21,140 --> 00:13:22,380
Or its limits?

120
00:13:23,260 --> 00:13:25,100
I thought I could do anything.

121
00:13:38,040 --> 00:13:39,180
Thank you.

122
00:14:11,240 --> 00:14:14,711
A game where it's okay to die
shouldn't be that big a deal.

123
00:14:20,200 --> 00:14:21,030
Asuna.

124
00:14:33,340 --> 00:14:34,200
Get away!

125
00:14:34,660 --> 00:14:35,500
Stay back!

126
00:14:45,280 --> 00:14:46,680
Uh!

127
00:14:55,880 --> 00:14:56,710
Kirito!

128
00:15:28,320 --> 00:15:30,220
Oh, my God.

129
00:15:50,400 --> 00:15:51,800
Kirito...

130
00:16:15,220 --> 00:16:16,050
Kirito!

131
00:16:27,140 --> 00:16:28,340
Thank you, Leafa.

132
00:16:29,280 --> 00:16:30,110
I...

133
00:16:30,193 --> 00:16:31,023
I didn't...

134
00:16:31,106 --> 00:16:32,799
Promise me you won't do that again.

135
00:16:33,160 --> 00:16:34,880
I can do this on my own.

136
00:16:35,640 --> 00:16:39,780
But I don't want to cause you any
more trouble. Trouble? But it's not!

137
00:16:40,100 --> 00:16:41,940
I was just...

138
00:16:45,700 --> 00:16:47,520
Hold on. Where are you going?

139
00:16:48,100 --> 00:16:48,930
Wait!

140
00:16:49,060 --> 00:16:50,942
You can't do this alone, Kirito!

141
00:16:52,840 --> 00:16:54,800
Yeah, maybe you're right.

142
00:16:55,160 --> 00:16:57,820
You know I'm right!
Listen! I'm going anyway.

143
00:17:02,720 --> 00:17:03,920
Please. Stop.

144
00:17:05,100 --> 00:17:07,320
Just go back to how you were.

145
00:17:08,840 --> 00:17:09,670
I...

146
00:17:09,753 --> 00:17:10,757
I just...

147
00:17:10,840 --> 00:17:13,060
You mean so much to me.

148
00:17:16,940 --> 00:17:17,770
Leafa.

149
00:17:21,640 --> 00:17:22,470
Sorry.

150
00:17:24,320 --> 00:17:26,860
If I don't get up there, nothing will end.

151
00:17:27,440 --> 00:17:28,580
Nothing will begin.

152
00:17:29,180 --> 00:17:30,760
I have to see her again.

153
00:17:31,080 --> 00:17:32,060
Just once.

154
00:17:32,900 --> 00:17:34,740
I have to see Asuna.

155
00:17:37,440 --> 00:17:38,440
What?

156
00:17:38,860 --> 00:17:40,580
What did you just say?

157
00:17:41,840 --> 00:17:42,960
Her name's Asuna.

158
00:17:44,240 --> 00:17:46,480
She's the one I've been looking for.

159
00:17:48,660 --> 00:17:49,577
But...

160
00:17:49,660 --> 00:17:52,077
But then...

161
00:17:52,160 --> 00:17:54,997
Then you're...

162
00:17:55,080 --> 00:17:56,380
Oh my god.

163
00:18:09,060 --> 00:18:11,300
Is that you, Kazuto?

164
00:18:11,920 --> 00:18:12,750
Huh?

165
00:18:14,700 --> 00:18:15,780
Sugu?

166
00:18:16,800 --> 00:18:18,080
Sugu-ha?

167
00:18:19,660 --> 00:18:21,660
I can't believe it!

168
00:18:22,100 --> 00:18:23,600
It's not fair!

169
00:18:24,120 --> 00:18:24,950
No!

170
00:18:25,340 --> 00:18:26,260
S-Sugu!

171
00:18:28,060 --> 00:18:29,980
Sugu! Sugu!

172
00:18:57,080 --> 00:19:00,540
I don't know.

173
00:19:08,480 --> 00:19:10,700
Sugu, it's me. Go away!

174
00:19:12,020 --> 00:19:12,900
Just go!

175
00:19:13,960 --> 00:19:15,160
Leave me alone!

176
00:19:18,180 --> 00:19:20,180
I want to know what's wrong, Sugu.

177
00:19:20,520 --> 00:19:23,049
I mean, it was kind of
a shock for me, too.

178
00:19:23,660 --> 00:19:27,197
And if you're mad because I'm using
the nerve gear again, I'm sorry.

179
00:19:27,280 --> 00:19:29,620
I just, I didn't have a choice.

180
00:19:30,520 --> 00:19:31,560
You're wrong!

181
00:19:32,460 --> 00:19:33,957
It's not why! I…

182
00:19:34,040 --> 00:19:37,700
it's not…

183
00:19:42,720 --> 00:19:43,997
I… I…

184
00:19:44,080 --> 00:19:45,560
I…

185
00:19:46,680 --> 00:19:49,220
I betrayed the feelings I had!

186
00:19:49,760 --> 00:19:53,000
I betrayed the love I felt… for you.

187
00:19:53,640 --> 00:19:56,140
When I met Kirito, I thought, finally,

188
00:19:56,360 --> 00:19:59,257
I could give up on all these
feelings I have for you.

189
00:19:59,340 --> 00:20:00,320
What the hell?

190
00:20:00,540 --> 00:20:01,700
I already had!

191
00:20:03,360 --> 00:20:05,820
But, but now I'm …

192
00:20:06,540 --> 00:20:09,977
Well, I mean love, but you and me were …

193
00:20:10,060 --> 00:20:11,520
No, we're not. Huh?

194
00:20:11,760 --> 00:20:13,220
I said, no, we're not!

195
00:20:13,980 --> 00:20:17,509
I know you're not really my
brother and I'm not your sister.

196
00:20:17,800 --> 00:20:21,280
I've known all along, for
the last two years anyway.

197
00:20:23,000 --> 00:20:25,037
That's why you quit Kendo, isn't it?

198
00:20:25,120 --> 00:20:27,002
And why you started avoiding me?

199
00:20:27,180 --> 00:20:29,977
It's because you knew the
whole time, didn't you?

200
00:20:30,060 --> 00:20:33,825
You pushed me away because I'm
not your real sister, didn't you?

201
00:20:34,420 --> 00:20:35,250
You did.

202
00:20:36,200 --> 00:20:39,494
Well, if that's how it is,
why do you care about me now?

203
00:20:40,760 --> 00:20:41,780
I just …

204
00:20:42,500 --> 00:20:46,600
I was so happy you came back from SAO.

205
00:20:47,520 --> 00:20:52,402
I was happy because you were being nice to
me again, just like when we were little.

206
00:20:52,800 --> 00:20:55,682
It felt like you were
finally giving me a chance.

207
00:20:55,960 --> 00:20:57,254
That's what I thought.

208
00:20:58,300 --> 00:21:03,680
But now, if this is how it is, I wish
you'd kept on being a jerk to me!

209
00:21:05,600 --> 00:21:10,020
If you had, I wouldn't have
realized how I felt about you.

210
00:21:10,480 --> 00:21:14,245
I wouldn't have felt sad and
jealous when I found out about her!

211
00:21:14,380 --> 00:21:16,137
And I wouldn't have tried forgetting about

212
00:21:16,220 --> 00:21:18,808
you and falling in love
with Kidito instead!

213
00:21:23,940 --> 00:21:24,920
I'm sorry.

214
00:21:33,560 --> 00:21:36,240
Go on, leave me alone.

215
00:22:01,920 --> 00:22:03,640
It's time for you.

216
00:22:32,940 --> 00:22:34,177
I'm not even sure how it's been.

217
00:22:34,260 --> 00:22:38,840
I don't know how it's been.

218
00:22:39,980 --> 00:22:44,620
I've been thinking about it.

219
00:22:45,480 --> 00:22:47,127
I've been thinking about it.

220
00:22:47,940 --> 00:22:48,897
I've been thinking about it.

221
00:22:48,980 --> 00:22:50,580
I'm not even late yet.

222
00:22:51,640 --> 00:22:54,100
I've been thinking about it.

223
00:23:22,680 --> 00:23:24,080
Oh, oh, oh, oh.

224
00:23:36,540 --> 00:23:38,540
Next time, B .O .N .S.
